---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Client Results"
  description="Read a 30-day client result from a customized OriginsLynk Tier 1 implementation with additional operator training."
>
  <section class="page-hero results-hero">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Client results</p>
      <h1>What clearer systems can make possible.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Real feedback from professionals using OriginsLynk to organize recurring work,
        build repeatable processes, and make progress without doing everything the long way.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="case-section section-cream">
    <article class="container case-study">
      <header class="case-header">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">30-day follow-up · Marketing operations</p>
          <h2>A year’s worth of progress in one month.</h2>
          <p class="lede">Customized founding-client Tier 1 implementation with additional operator training for the Director of Marketing at The Downing Group.</p>
        </div>
        <dl class="result-facts" aria-label="Engagement summary">
          <div>
            <dt>Reported time saved</dt>
            <dd>At least 20 hours a week</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Follow-up period</dt>
            <dd>30 days</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Client investment</dt>
            <dd>$1,250 one-time</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </header>

      <div class="case-details">
        <div>
          <h3>The starting point</h3>
          <p>
            The client was managing content, systems, lead generation, agent recruiting,
            websites, reporting, multiple agents, and ongoing projects that all needed to
            work together.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>What changed</h3>
          <p>
            OriginsLynk provided a role-specific operating environment and a method for turning
            recurring work into reusable skills. After the initial setup and instruction, the
            client continued creating and refining role-specific marketing workflows independently.
            The custom scope extended beyond the standard Tier 1 package.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="delivery-scope" aria-labelledby="delivery-heading">
        <div class="delivery-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">Inside the engagement</p>
          <h3 id="delivery-heading">More than two finished workflows.</h3>
          <p>
            The expanded scope paired completed workflow implementation with the structure
            and instruction needed for the client to continue improving the system.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="delivery-grid">
          <div>
            <span>01</span>
            <h4>Customized Tier 1 foundation</h4>
            <p>Two client-started workflows configured around one professional’s real responsibilities.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span>02</span>
            <h4>Role-specific environment</h4>
            <p>Operating instructions shaped around the client’s work, systems, voice, and approval boundaries.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span>03</span>
            <h4>Reusable skill-building method</h4>
            <p>A guided process for turning repeated work into defined, testable, reusable workflows.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span>04</span>
            <h4>Operator training and guardrails</h4>
            <p>Hands-on instruction, safe testing, documentation, and human approval where it matters.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <figure class="full-testimonial">
        <blockquote>
          <p>
            “Working as Marketing Director for a top real estate team in our area means managing
            a lot of moving parts—content, systems, lead generation, agent recruiting, websites,
            reporting, multiple agents, and ongoing projects that all need to work together.
          </p>
          <p>
            Primitive Origins, LLC gave me a way to bring real structure to that work. In just
            one month, I’ve been able to systemize tasks, organize projects, build repeatable
            workflows, and create processes that have already saved me countless hours.
          </p>
          <p>
            What has impressed me most is that this goes far beyond basic marketing support. It
            has helped me take on major projects I would have otherwise needed years to fully
            understand and confidently implement—Google Analytics cleanup, website restructuring
            and creation, UTM tracking, lead tracking, call tracking, and better systems for
            turning our marketing into measurable results.
          </p>
          <p class="testimonial-highlight">
            I genuinely feel like I have accomplished a year’s worth of work in a single month.
          </p>
          <p>
            More importantly, I now have a clear path for continuing to improve our team’s lead
            generation, website experience, reporting, and overall marketing operations.
          </p>
          <p>
            It is hard to put an exact number on the time this has saved, because it has not only
            saved hours—it has accelerated my ability to learn, make decisions, and build systems
            that will continue benefiting our business long-term. The potential for growth feels
            limitless, and I am incredibly grateful for what Primitive Origins has made possible.
          </p>
          <p>I highly recommend them to any professional tired of doing things the long way.”</p>
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption>
          Director of Marketing, The Downing Group
          <span>Client feedback lightly edited only to correct spacing.</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <p class="results-note">
        This is one client’s reported experience, not a promise of identical results. Outcomes
        depend on the work, scope, participation, tools, and operating environment. This custom
        engagement included additional operator training and was priced above the standard Tier 1
        package; current services and prices are listed on the <a href="/pricing">pricing page</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="final-cta">
    <div class="container container-narrow final-inner">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Start with the work that repeats</p>
        <h2>Find the smallest useful system for your business.</h2>
      </div>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Request a service</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .results-hero { background: radial-gradient(circle at 82% 20%, rgba(32,122,114,.1), transparent 34%), var(--ground); }
  .results-hero h1 { max-width: 14ch; }
  .results-hero .lede { max-width: 56ch; margin-top: var(--space-5); }
  .case-study { display: grid; gap: var(--space-8); }
  .case-header { display: grid; gap: var(--space-7); }
  .case-header h2 { max-width: 18ch; }
  .case-header .lede { margin-top: var(--space-4); }
  .result-facts { display: grid; gap: var(--space-3); }
  .result-facts div { padding: var(--space-4); border-left: var(--border-thick) solid var(--secondary); background: var(--ground-raised); }
  .result-facts dt { color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: var(--text-xs); font-weight: 720; letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .result-facts dd { margin-top: var(--space-2); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--heading-font); font-size: var(--text-xl); font-weight: var(--heading-weight); line-height: var(--leading-tight); }
  .case-details { display: grid; gap: var(--space-5); }
  .case-details > div { padding-top: var(--space-5); border-top: var(--border-thin) solid var(--rule-strong); }
  .case-details p { margin-top: var(--space-3); color: var(--ink-muted); }
  .delivery-scope { display: grid; gap: var(--space-7); padding: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, var(--space-8)); border: var(--border-thin) solid var(--rule); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--ground-raised); }
  .delivery-heading h3 { max-width: 17ch; font-size: var(--text-2xl); }
  .delivery-heading > p:last-child { margin-top: var(--space-4); color: var(--ink-muted); }
  .delivery-grid { display: grid; gap: var(--space-4); }
  .delivery-grid > div { padding-top: var(--space-4); border-top: var(--border-thin) solid var(--rule-strong); }
  .delivery-grid span { color: var(--accent-text); font-size: var(--text-xs); font-weight: 800; }
  .delivery-grid h4 { margin-top: var(--space-2); }
  .delivery-grid p { margin-top: var(--space-2); color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: var(--text-sm); }
  .full-testimonial { padding: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, var(--space-8)); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--ground-inverse); color: var(--ink-inverse); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); }
  .full-testimonial blockquote { display: grid; gap: var(--space-5); }
  .full-testimonial blockquote p { color: var(--ink-inverse-muted); }
  .full-testimonial .testimonial-highlight { max-width: 30ch; color: var(--ink-inverse); font-family: var(--heading-font); font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 3vw, 2.2rem); font-weight: var(--heading-weight); line-height: var(--leading-tight); }
  .full-testimonial figcaption { margin-top: var(--space-7); padding-top: var(--space-5); border-top: var(--border-thin) solid var(--rule-inverse); font-weight: 680; }
  .full-testimonial figcaption span { display: block; margin-top: var(--space-2); color: var(--ink-inverse-muted); font-size: var(--text-xs); font-weight: 500; }
  .results-note { color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: var(--text-xs); }
  .final-inner { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--space-6); }
  .final-inner h2 { max-width: 18ch; }
  @media (min-width: 46em) {
    .result-facts { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
    .case-details { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .delivery-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
  @media (min-width: 64em) {
    .case-header { grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr; align-items: end; }
    .delivery-scope { grid-template-columns: .7fr 1.3fr; }
  }
</style>
